{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["在那日，七个女人必拉住一个男人，说：「我们吃自己的食物，穿自己的衣服，但求你许我们归你名下；求你除掉我们的羞耻。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的重建"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["到那日，耶和华发生的苗必华美尊荣，地的出产必为以色列逃脱的人显为荣华茂盛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["主以公义的灵和焚烧的灵，将锡安女子的污秽洗去，又将耶路撒冷中杀人的血除净。那时，剩在锡安、留在耶路撒冷的，就是一切住耶路撒冷、在生命册上记名的，必称为圣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华也必在锡安全山，并各会众以上，使白日有烟云，黑夜有火焰的光。因为在全荣耀之上必有遮蔽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["必有亭子，白日可以得荫避暑，也可以作为藏身之处，躲避狂风暴雨。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}